    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Cozy Nook: Designing for Jada\r\n\r\n**The User:** Jada owns \"The Purr-fect Page,\" a cat café and bookstore where customers can rent cozy reading nooks. She needs a booking system with a \"Cottagecore\" vibe.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Write a detailed prompt for AI Tutor to help you generate your web app layout. Your prompt must address the following three questions:\r\n\r\n1. What is the goal? \r\n> What information (e.g., cat names, available time slots, waitlist) does the booking system keep track of?\r\n\r\n2. What are the constraints?\r\n> What specific fonts, colors, and text should the page use to feel cozy?\r\n\r\n3. What are the edge cases?\r\n> How should the website handle a situation where all the reading nooks are booked or all the cats are asleep?",
